{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "4d89c812594f23d2f94ec0625b49f28b02334b5e0baa42ef8b8fb6a396deaef5", "ja": "へっ？　オタワムレ？　オタワムレ、タワムレ……\nはれ～？", "zh": "诶？玩笑？玩笑、胡闹……咦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
