{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "3a200976fd482110c77e481a51af49a17bec4f0200be148458385f4770050d88", "ja": "うわ～ん！　ひどいです{$P$}さん！\n中学生でもわかる言葉にしてくださいよぉ～！", "zh": "呜哇——！太过分了{$P$}先生！\n请用连初中生都能听懂的词嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8e4bf682f694b210e1122d2acd554d347a50554e6a280869cd6f643f3be187c3", "ja": "中学で習う漢字だと思うけど……まぁいいか。\nそれより、衣装のフィッティングは問題なさそうか？", "zh": "我觉得这是初中会学到的汉字……不过，算了。比起这个，服装试穿还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "789cdb5de239c2150bb6119feff4a1b29402276132560d09cf82c648fc3a74cc", "ja": "はいっ、問題ありません！　すごくかわいくて、\nお姫様みたいな衣装で、ステキなんですけど……。", "zh": "是的，没问题！这套衣服特别可爱，像公主一样漂亮，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "de9959b6c95ae9a5b5a8339d2cb08888885cdf6f1f0b3d4969f8dde3c5db5153", "ja": "問題は、中身なんですよね～。はぁ……。", "zh": "问题在于内在啊～。唉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1011_p", "source_sha256": "de9b963c9b5dddf045b4ccd9f624a335b7a0a35b202aed21bcfe0941da83a51c", "ja": "いや、そんなに落ち込まなくても……。\n令嬢としての役作りは、これからなんだし。", "zh": "不，也不用这么沮丧吧……\n作为千金小姐的角色塑造，这才刚刚开始呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "0121e572ff7ad80ac9dee3334d42c9a72914112a4e03e056b2588dda2ab29bca", "ja": "そうですけど！　でもでも、本番では、誰が見ても\n上品でセレブなお嬢様にならなきゃですよね？", "zh": "是这样没错！可是可是，正式演出时，必须成为任谁看了都觉得优雅又高贵的大小姐，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "ff827c615555ec3fcf6881c69fe94c3d83963fec5b42a4a80cd47debab188088", "ja": "伊織さんとか、千鶴さんみたいな！", "zh": "像伊织小姐、千鹤小姐那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "510a9caa4b88352b6dd67f58c63a860c3b47ecc69cb703906e5af044ecb247d1", "ja": "あ～あ、どうしたらなれるかな～？\nセレブのコツって何かな～♪", "zh": "唉～怎么才能变成那样呢～？\n名媛的诀窍到底是什么呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1015_p", "source_sha256": "89543de8f042626e8f72bab3c770d8249981df8e00772a5aa859b58e668fdf73", "ja": "流石に、コツなんてないんじゃないかな。\n本人のひたむきな努力というか……。", "zh": "说到底，应该没有什么诀窍吧。\n也就是本人的不懈努力之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "b66be6d2f87be7630feedf4c84a6e3d035b30fd1e7d42d599c96d919d4358290", "ja": "ええ～！　でも、そっかぁ。そうですよね。\n歌だって、近道なんてないですもんね！", "zh": "诶——！不过，说得也是。确实如此呢。\n唱歌也是没有捷径的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "e2ba53ddc625e2523409de82779589aea6e6ed8dd3fa9feaa733c0e006002433", "ja": "毎日、がんばって練習して……。\n心から、楽しいって気持ちを込めて歌うから。", "zh": "每天努力练习……  \n因为唱歌时倾注了发自内心的快乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "fa73d87064533d9592a719ab492ee4a00ee513d49a1302586de244f9374979cf", "ja": "だから聴いてる人達にも、\n楽しんでもらえるんですよね！", "zh": "所以听歌的人也会觉得开心，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9c679a20bc385b68cb431d4df0135f22e65a113139be4c1641daac4037dedc7d", "ja": "そうだな。そして可奈は、たくさん練習してるし、\n心を込めて歌うこともできる……。", "zh": "没错。而且可奈也一直在认真练习，还能用心歌唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7a2e3a6a9475606b7706e571bf19d3fb2f7fccbf212edbf596849cf76639644a", "ja": "同じように心を込めて演じれば、\n令嬢にだってなれるよ。", "zh": "只要像那样倾注心意去演，\n千金小姐也能演得出来哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "196c6eefefc41a4e8149613757b851c9691b0b8e660796a27e6e87f384baca97", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへ。\n褒められちゃった、うれちいな～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿。\n被夸奖了，好开心呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0444_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "b8451c08a75db84fa6f73c86d012cac5ae4c8feb2f30200c91ae46411f8942d1", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n私、お芝居の練習、がんばりますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n我会努力练习演戏的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
